{"id":"73d50b57f841d971","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy Strict","display":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict — Arithmetical Hierarchy Strict","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict","aliases":["88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict"],"display":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict — Arithmetical Hierarchy Strict","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict — Arithmetical Hierarchy Strict"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54b34b456e49359d\" href=\"?note=54b34b456e49359d\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> (positive hierarchy level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\\)</span> (arithmetical-hierarchy classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54b34b456e49359d\" href=\"?note=54b34b456e49359d\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma_n^0\\setminus\\Pi_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\n\\Pi_n^0\\setminus\\Sigma_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma_n^0\\setminus\\Pi_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\n\\Pi_n^0\\setminus\\Sigma_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>算术层级是真层次结构</li>\n<li>每个正层级都有只属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span>一侧和只属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Pi_n^0\\)</span>一侧的集合</li>\n<li>这是算术层级的基本定理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full","status":"resolved","id":"54b34b456e49359d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full","status":"resolved","id":"54b34b456e49359d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0$ (arithmetical-hierarchy classes, see [[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}strict} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma_n^0\\setminus\\Pi_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\land\n\\Pi_n^0\\setminus\\Sigma_n^0\\neq\\emptyset\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n^0","display":false}],"bytes":907,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactn